# Web Package (`packages/web`)

- Use the Next.js App Router. Before inventing APIs, check `AGENTS.md` and local Next docs under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
- Put client state in Zustand stores under `store/`.
- Import shared UI from `@smart-pantry/ui`, not by duplicating components.
- Prefer Server Components by default; mark `"use client"` only when interactivity or hooks are required.
- Keep TypeScript strict; never use `any`.
- File placement: `.cursor/rules/web-architecture.mdc`. Feature layering: skill `web-layering`.
- Performance: `.cursor/rules/web-performance.mdc` and skill `vercel-react-best-practices`.
